 Less paperwork for pediatricians, more care for kids 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 UnitedHealth Group is fast-tracking more than 60% of procedures for children that used to need pre-approval, including genetic testing and some surgical procedures.


