 4. 🏀 1 sports thing: Gators top preseason poll 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: AP . Chart: Axios Florida will start the men's college basketball season where the team ended two seasons ago: No. 1.

 The Gators were the overwhelming pick to top this year's preseason AP Top 25, nabbing 47 of the 59 first-place votes. 🐊 Florida started last season at No. 3, but crashed out of the poll entirely by early January. 

 The Gators rallied to win the Southeastern Conference regular-season championship — only to get stunned by Iowa in the second round of the NCAA Tournament. Go deeper . 

 
 
