 For rural doctors, less paperwork means more time with patients 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Many rural hospitals are their community’s only source of care. UnitedHealth Group is reducing paperwork and accelerating payments for more than 1,500 of those hospitals.


 The impact: These changes will help local doctors spend less time on administrative work and more time with patients.


